accept_75701_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Young hero,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >what brings you here?</font>
accept_75702_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will personally test new disciples with questions upon your arrival at Kunlun. </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >There is no need to be nervous, just answer truthfully.</font>
accept_75703_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You have made great progress in a short time. But you still need to work hard.</font>
accept_75704_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You have been staying here for some time and learned level 3 Internal Force, and your power has made considerable progress. This Millennium Earth Ganoderma Pill can help you improve your Meridian Activation upper limit to 5. Try it.</font>
accept_75705_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You have learned the third inner. This pill is to help you unlock the maximum number of activated meridians to 6. Here it is.</font>
accept_75706_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You have learned the fourth inner. This pill is to help you unlock the maximum number of activated meridians to 7. Here it is.</font>
accept_75707_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You have learned the fifth inner. This pill is to help you unlock the maximum number of activated meridians to 8. Here it is.</font>
accept_75708_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You have joined Kunlun Sect for some time now.</font>
accept_75712_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Yu Ying's aunt is one of the top ten villains, Bao San Gu, who holds a high position in the Ruined Valley. I don't know who instigated behind the scenes to escalate the conflict between our sect and the Ruined Valley. Yu Ying is caught in the middle and it must be difficult for her. You should go visit her when you have time.</font>
accept_75718_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Congratulations, we both joined Kunlun on the same day. I didn't expect that there would be such a huge difference between us. Now you are highly favored by our masters and elders. I heard you have been given an important task recently, tsk tsk tsk...</font>
accept_75720_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Next, you must not reveal a single word of what you hear.</font>
accept_75723_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What a coincidence. What are you doing here?</font>
accept_75730_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You have come at the right time. I was about to send for you.</font>
accept_75731_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This dying man should reappear.</font>
accept_75732_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You've come at the right time. This is a thorny matter.</font>
accept_75733_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >If you want to improve yourself, set off for the Hero Island now. There are many masters of all the schools guarding the Hero Island. They will teach you their key absolute skills.</font>
accept_75751_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >There is a fairy mountain on the sea, hidden in the void. The buildings are exquisite and the clouds rise, with many beautiful fairies living there.</font>
accept_75752_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It seems that you are a disciple of Tianya Haige, what brings you here to find me?</font>
accept_75753_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >How does the Master Yunyangzi respond?</font>
accept_75754_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >As the masters of Kunlun and Tianya Haige are sworn brothers, we are like branches of the same tree. I am happy to teach the martial arts of Kunlun to strengthen the disciples of Tianya Haige. However, teaching martial arts is a major matter for the sect and requires permission from the master and the consent of the leader of the secluded pavilion.</font>
accept_75755_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You should go to the disciples stationed in various places to inquire about the situation.</font>
accept_75756_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Go to the seaside and find Gong Yangjun to go fishing by boat.</font>
accept_75757_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You should go and repair the boats docked in various places.</font>
accept_75758_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Follow me to practice Dream Brush Manual under the waterfall.</font>
complete_75701=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The Kunlun Sect takes its name from Mount Kunlun and has established itself as a separate sect, competing with the major sects of the Central Plains. The Kunlun Sect follows the principle of welcoming all talents. My young friend, if you are determined to join Kunlun Sect, <font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > will not make things difficult for you. From now on, you will be a disciple of Kunlun Sect.</font>
complete_75702=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Kunlun Mountain is the source of the four seas and the origin of vitality. Since ancient times, Kunlun Mountain has been revered as the mountain of the ancestor dragon. Therefore, Kunlun Mountain has many secrets and forbidden areas that must not be recklessly entered. Those who violate the prohibition will be severely punished, and may even be expelled from the sect without any leniency. </font>
complete_75703=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff"> You skill has greatly improved. Take this medicine. It will help you with your Cultivation in the future.</font>
complete_75704=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Martial Arts emphasize learning in a sequential, step-by-step manner. Don't be impatient. Although this pill has a magical effect, taking too much is harmful to our bodies. Your power is not enough now. I will give it to you when you are stronger.</font>
complete_75705=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Congratulations, your Tier 3 Internal Skill has reached Level 30. Don't forget to cultivate your Meridians. </font>
complete_75706=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Through hard cultivation every day, you have obtained a great achievement. Keep going and you will have much greater successes in the future.</font>
complete_75707=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Through hard cultivation every day, you have obtained a great achievement. Keep going and you will have much greater successes in the future.</font>
complete_75709=<font face="Default" color="#ff0228" >(Shakes head and sighs) </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >At first, we thought he had been ambushed or deceived, which led to his wrongdoing. But no matter how we asked, Senior Lu remained silent. The master was furious and wanted to expel him from the sect. We all pleaded for him, but Senior Lu still refused to defend himself. The next day, he left Kunlun Mountain without looking back...</font>
complete_75711=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I heard that a large group of villains from the Ruined Valley came to cause trouble earlier and even injured some of our disciples. How is the situation now?</font>
complete_75713=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you for your help. Young man, I have made a big mistake and regret it for life. I hope you will take it as a lesson.</font>
complete_75714=Recently, there has been a turn of events for Jia Ping. He was able to speak intermittently three times. He told me that he wanted to go home... go home... I know that his home is Kunlun Sect. So... no matter how difficult it may be, I will fulfill Jia Ping's wish!
complete_75715=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Yes, Senior Lu was once a brilliant and outstanding member of the Kunlun sect, but unfortunately...he is no longer with us, and I have become the eldest senior brother</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >. Some people</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >say that I</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >have taken advantage, </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >but they do not know that my master has never entrusted me with the same responsibilities as he did with Senior Lu</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >nor has he ever mentioned the secrets of Kunlun to me</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
complete_75719=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This time, Japanese has risen again and has secretly colluded with several other forces from foreign lands, including the Esoteric sect.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The path of protecting the pulse is full of dangers and difficulties, have you thought it through?</font>
complete_75723=The real map and key of the dragon pulse have been destroyed, and one day, I will also turn into dust and rest here forever, guarding Kunlun.
complete_75730=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Well done. People are hearing what happened at Tiger Roaring Villa.</font>
complete_75731=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You have done well, and I will reward you greatly.</font>
complete_75732=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Good! This matter is a great achievement, and we will reward you greatly!</font>
complete_75733=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Set off now. </font> </font>
complete_75751=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > Who are you?</font>
complete_75752=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Have you met Master Yunyangzi?</font>
complete_75753=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >So, are you ready to learn?</font>
complete_75755=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >If you have nothing else, you may leave. This is your reward.</font>
complete_75756=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You did well, this is your reward</font>
complete_75757=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Congratulations, this is your reward</font>
complete_75758=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You have a basic understanding of the Dream Microscale, but you still need more practice</font>
context_75701=To join the Kunlun Sect, first go to Kunlun Mountain and meet with the master of the sect, Yunyangzi.
context_75702=Listen carefully to the master's teachings.
context_75703=Since you joined Tianshan Sect, you have cultivated hard. The headmaster speaks highly about you.
context_75704=Along with the improvement of Internal Energy, you can increase the upper limit of meridians that can be activated through medicine.
context_75705=Along with the improvement of Internal Energy, you can increase the upper limit of meridians that can be activated through medicine.
context_75706=Along with the improvement of Internal Energy, you can increase the upper limit of meridians that can be activated through medicine.
context_75707=Along with the improvement of Internal Energy, you can increase the upper limit of meridians that can be activated through medicine.
context_75708=As a new member of the sect, there may be some things you don't understand, so go to the master for guidance.
context_75709=Ask Shishu Guchenzi for some Golden Wound Medicine, but unexpectedly witness an old man bullying a disabled disciple. Hurriedly step in to stop it.
context_75710=The people from the Ruined Valley come to cause trouble, go and investigate.
context_75711=The people from the Ruined Valley come to cause trouble, drive them away.
context_75712=At the request of the eldest senior brother, go and comfort the frightened junior sister.
context_75713=Unexpectedly discovered that the little junior sister had secret dealings with a beggar, which was quite suspicious, so I went to inquire about the situation.
context_75714=A strange man crawled out of the cave, crazy and terrifying. I first subdued him and then went to ask Hua Moxun.
context_75715=Repelled the sudden appearance of black-clothed ninjas.
context_75716=The master suddenly summoned me, so I hurriedly went to discuss important matters.
context_75717=Inquired about the origins of the situation from Guchenzi.
context_75718=Dabie Idleman spread false news about the dragon vein map, so we must be careful and find the traitor.
context_75719=According to the markings on the map, I found the master.
context_75720=Listened to the master's teachings and learned about the secrets of the ancient dragon veins in Kunlun.
context_75721=Brought the Japanese person into the treasure vault, and then figured out a way to escape, which was the best plan.
context_75722=Following the master's orders, I went to meet Senior Lu Jiaping and unexpectedly learned about his passing.
context_75723=I informed Senior Brother Cao Yi'an of the news of Senior Brother Lu's passing and brought him to Senior Brother Lu's grave.
context_75730=Lately, there have been many affairs within the sect, and as disciples of Kunlun, we cannot sit idly by. Now that the sect leader has summoned us, there must be important matters at hand.
context_75731=Recently, there have been rumors in jianghu that the person who was once pursued by Kunlun has reappeared. The sect leader's summons must be related to this matter, so it is best to go see the sect leader and follow their instructions as soon as possible.
context_75732=Recently, there have been widespread rumors in the martial arts world about the Butterfly Killer, causing fear in everyone's hearts. This summons from the sect leader must be related to this matter.
context_75733=The port has been damaged by pirates and I lost the headmaster's Token. Now the journey has to be postponed. I need to go back and tell the headmaster what happened, then see what to do next.
context_75734=Jianghu VIPs can join Kunlun and, once they reach a certain level of strength, can go to Senior Brother Kunlun for certification and promotion, allowing for rapid growth.
context_75735=Jianghu VIPs can join Kunlun and, once they reach a certain level of strength, can go to Senior Brother Kunlun for certification and promotion, allowing for rapid growth.
context_75736=Jianghu VIPs can join Kunlun and, once they reach a certain level of strength, can go to Senior Brother Kunlun for certification and promotion, allowing for rapid growth.
context_75737=Jianghu VIPs can join Kunlun and, once they reach a certain level of strength, can go to Senior Brother Kunlun for certification and promotion, allowing for rapid growth.
context_75738=Jianghu VIPs can join Kunlun and, once they reach a designated level of strength, can go to Senior Brother Kunlun to receive rewards.
context_75739=Jianghu VIPs can join Kunlun and, once they reach a designated level of strength, can go to Senior Brother Kunlun to receive rewards.
context_75751=It was discovered that an unknown person was inside the Tianya Haige. Inquire about their intentions.
context_75752=Visit the master of the Kunlun sect, Yunyangzi.
context_75753=Reply to the pavilion leader that the master of the Kunlun sect, Yunyangzi, has approved Yuan Chen to teach the martial arts of the Kunlun sect.
context_75754=Reply to Yuan Chen, the head of the Tianya Haige hopes that he can teach the martial arts of the Kunlun sect at the Tianya Haige, and the head of the Kunlun sect, Yunyangzi, has also agreed.
context_75755=Go to the Tianya Haige to inspect various places.
context_75756=Go to the seaside to find Gongyang Jun and take a boat out to sea for fishing.
context_75757=Go to repair the boats docked in various places.
context_75758=Go to the waterfall to find Huo Sheng and practice Dream Brush Manual, familiarizing oneself with the martial arts.
menu_75701_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have traveled from afar to Kunlun Mountain, only for one thing, which is to be able to join the Kunlun sect in my lifetime and achieve great success.</font>
menu_75702_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will surely speak without holding back.</font>
menu_75703_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you for your guidance, Master.</font>
menu_75704_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thanks, Leader.</font>
menu_75705_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thanks, Leader.</font>
menu_75706_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thanks, Leader.</font>
menu_75707_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thanks, Leader.</font>
menu_75708_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, Master</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, for your concern. However, I still don't have a thorough understanding of the sect.</font>
menu_75712_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Yes, Elder Brother.</font>
menu_75718_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Junior brother, you don't know everything. Some things are just a coincidence that I happened to come across.</font>
menu_75720_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff">I understand!</font>
menu_75723_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior brother...</font>
menu_75730_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Why does the headmaster want to meet me?</font>
menu_75731_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Whom do you refer to, master?</font>
menu_75732_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I'm not sure what you're referring to, Master?</font>
menu_75733_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff">Yes, sir!</font>
menu_75751_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Why did you come to visit Tianya Haige?</font>
menu_75752_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have heard that the Kunlun sect and the Tianya Haige have a history. It happened that the senior of the Kunlun sect, Yuan Chen, came to visit the Tianya Haige. I tell the master of the Haige that I want to learn the martial arts of the Kunlun sect. The leader of the Haige ordered me to visit you to seek permission.</font>
menu_75753_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The head of the school, Yunyangzi, has agreed Yuan Chen to teach the martial arts of the Kunlun Sect.</font>
menu_75754_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What you said is true. I have already consulted with the master of the secluded pavilion, and at the order of the master, I have met with the master of the school, Yunyangzi, who has agreed you to teach the martial arts of the Kunlun sect at the Tianya Haige.</font>
menu_75755_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff">I obey the order.</font>
menu_75756_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff">I obey the order.</font>
menu_75757_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff">I obey the order.</font>
menu_75758_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff">I obey the order.</font>
