submit_75701=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you, Master, for accepting me into Kunlun. I will never forget my original intention and will continue to strive forward.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > </font>
submit_75702=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have taken note of your teachings, Master.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > </font>
submit_75703=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you, Master, I will accept it.</font>
submit_75704=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I am foolish. Thank you for your advice, leader.</font>
submit_75705=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will remember. </font>
submit_75706=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will remember. </font>
submit_75707=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you, Headmaster.</font>
submit_75709=Perhaps, he also has his own difficulties...
submit_75711=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Reporting to Senior Brother, the people of the Ruined Valley were already convinced by Junior Sister Huayuying, but they were attacked by a third party, which sparked conflicts. However, they have now been repelled.</font>
submit_75713=<font face="Default" color="#f9040d" >(The words of this Uncle Hua are confusing)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will remember your teachings.</font>
submit_75714=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I never expected that our missing senior brother has had such a difficult time in these years, and has suffered so much injustice.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...</font>
submit_75715=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior brother,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >you're overthinking...</font>
submit_75719=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master, although I am not as good as our senior brother, I am willing to sacrifice myself for the greater good of our nation.</font>
submit_75723=<font face="Default" color="#e81747" >(Feeling shocked, speechless for a moment)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master...</font>
submit_75730=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thanks for the compliment, master.</font>
submit_75731=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you for your reward, Master.</font>
submit_75732=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Many thanks. </font> </font>
submit_75733=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Visit the Headmaster (Can be submitted) </font>
submit_75751=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I am a disciple of Tianya Haige, and I have come to pay my respects to the head of Kunlun Sect at the request of our sect leader.</font>
submit_75752=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >He is well. He sends you his best regards.</font>
submit_75753=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior Yuan, I have heard of the exceptional martial arts of Kunlun Sect. Would you be willing to teach me?</font>
submit_75755=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Farewell.</font>
submit_75756=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Farewell.</font>
submit_75757=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Farewell.</font>
submit_75758=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Farewell.</font>
